  (b) Z-test  : ~7.21e-04 bits per lost packet;  packets sprayed to detect (k=64, z_Bonf=3.16, power .8) = 1,026,274,131  -> ratio (b)/(a) = 1,026,274x
  (c) probing : budget 1% of links per epoch, 1 probe each -> epochs to attribution = 100,000 (vs witness 1,000 production packets on f)
